<programme start="20261012023000 +0000" stop="20261012033000 +0000" channel="ESPN U"><title lang="en">SEC Storied</title><sub-title lang="en">Miracles on the Plains</sub-title><desc lang="en">The poisoning of Auburn&apos;s historic oaks at Toomer&apos;s Corner in January 2011 seemed to signal a change of fortunes for the previously successful football program. Then, the program turned things around during a magical 2013 season.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Documentary</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p8766233_b_v8_ab.jpg"/></programme>
