<programme start="20261012040000 +0000" stop="20261012070000 +0000" channel="FS2 🇺🇸"><title lang="en">College Football</title><sub-title lang="en">Indiana at Nebraska</sub-title><desc lang="en">No. 7 Indiana visits Nebraska in a Week 6 Big Ten game. Indiana beat Rutgers 47-15 in Week 5 for its fifth straight win, while Nebraska beat Maryland 48-23. Josh Hoover leads Indiana, while Nebraska is paced by quarterback Anthony Colandrea.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Football</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191261_b_v12_ab.jpg"/></programme>
