<programme start="20261012160000 +0000" stop="20261012180000 +0000" channel="Lifetime Movies"><title lang="en">Framed by My Sister</title><desc lang="en">Twins Reina and Alex find their lives upended by their mysterious triplet Trinity, who was separated from them at birth and who has devised a plan to frame one for murder and assume the identity of the other.</desc><credits><actor>Scout Taylor-Compton</actor><actor>T. K. Richardson</actor><actor>Tracy Nelson</actor></credits><date>20220101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Thriller</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p21400040_k_h8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261012180000 +0000" stop="20261012200000 +0000" channel="Lifetime Movies"><title lang="en">The Kept Mistress Killer</title><desc lang="en">Catherine is hired for a job after she meets the CEO, Paul, at her interview. They fall in love, and everything seems perfect, until Paul&apos;s ex-wife&apos;s dead body is found in his mansion.</desc><credits><actor>Alicia Leigh Willis</actor><actor>Matthew Pohlkamp</actor><actor>Sallie Glaner</actor></credits><date>20230101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Thriller</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-G</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p25004287_st_h10_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261012200000 +0000" stop="20261012220000 +0000" channel="Lifetime Movies"><title lang="en">Secrets of a Gold Digger Killer</title><desc lang="en">Multimillionaire Steven Beard showers his beloved wife, Celeste, with cars, jewelry and designer clothes. However, while staying at a mental health facility for depression, Celeste tries to convince a fellow patient to kill her husband for the money.</desc><credits><actor>Eli Gabay</actor><actor>Julie Benz</actor><actor>Justine Warrington</actor></credits><date>20210101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Docu-Drama</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-PG</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p19834100_k_h8_ad.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261012220000 +0000" stop="20261013000000 +0000" channel="Lifetime Movies"><title lang="en">Blackmail, Lies, and Murder</title><desc lang="en">Candace and Kristen&apos;s conversation takes a dark turn when Kristen suggests they each kill someone who is tormenting them -- but swap the murders. Candace laughs it off, but when her mother-in-law ends up dead, Kristen expects her to return the favor.</desc><credits><actor>Kelsey McKean</actor><actor>Lauren Pike</actor><actor>Nick Ritacco</actor></credits><date>20240101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Thriller</category><rating system="MPA"><value>TV-14</value></rating><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p26676252_k_h8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261013000000 +0000" stop="20261013020000 +0000" channel="Lifetime Movies"><title lang="en">How to Murder Your Husband: The Nancy Brophy Story</title><desc lang="en">Author Nancy Crampton-Brophy often writes stories about female protagonists who fantasize about killing their own husbands. In a shocking and ironic turn of events, Brophy faces accusations of doing the same thing in real life.</desc><credits><actor>Cybill Shepherd</actor><actor>Steve Guttenberg</actor></credits><date>20230101</date><category lang="en">Movies</category><category lang="en">Drama</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p23431097_k_h8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
