<programme start="20261011110000 +0000" stop="20261011130000 +0000" channel="SN360 🇨🇦"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Nashville Predators at Ottawa Senators</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Predators visit the Canadian Tire Centre to face the Senators. Nashville holds a series edge, winning six of their last 10 meetings. Their previous clash was a 5-3 Predators win after overcoming a 3-0 deficit with five straight goals.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
