<programme start="20261011180000 +0000" stop="20261011200000 +0000" channel="SNP"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Toronto Maple Leafs at Colorado Avalanche</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Maple Leafs visit the Avalanche at Ball Arena in Denver for an NHL regular-season game. Colorado beat Toronto 4-1 on Jan. 25 and leads the head-to-head. Nathan MacKinnon defends home ice against visiting star William Nylander in this game.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261011200000 +0000" stop="20261011220000 +0000" channel="SNP"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Anaheim Ducks at Calgary Flames</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Anaheim Ducks visit the Calgary Flames for a Pacific Division battle. The Ducks look to build on a clean 2-0-0 opening stretch behind Cutter Gauthier&apos;s four early points, while the Flames seek their first victory at the Scotiabank Saddledome.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261011220000 +0000" stop="20261012003000 +0000" channel="SNP"><title lang="en">NHL Hockey</title><sub-title lang="en">Vancouver Canucks at New York Rangers</sub-title><desc lang="en">The Vancouver Canucks visit the New York Rangers at Madison Square Garden. Through their last three meetings, New York currently holds a 2-1 edge over Vancouver, but Vancouver shut out New York 3-0 in their previous clash on Dec. 16, 2025.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Hockey</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p191278_b_v12_aa.jpg"/></programme>
