<programme start="20261012010000 +0000" stop="20261012013000 +0000" channel="Spectrum SportsNet LA"><title lang="en">Backstage: Dodgers</title><sub-title lang="en">2026 Season Episode 1</sub-title><desc lang="en">Edwin Diaz and Kyle Tucker join the team at Camelback Ranch as the Dodgers prepare for the 2026 season. Roki Sasaki reflects on the ups and downs of his rookie season including his postseason success as a reliever.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Baseball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p10548110_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
<programme start="20261012013000 +0000" stop="20261012020000 +0000" channel="Spectrum SportsNet LA"><title lang="en">Backstage: Dodgers</title><sub-title lang="en">2026 Season Episode 2</sub-title><desc lang="en">Miguel Rojas and Clayton Kershaw are mic&apos;d up as they receive their 2025 World Series championship rings. The Dodgers head back to Toronto where Rojas and Andy Pages relive their biggest World Series moments.</desc><category lang="en">Sports</category><category lang="en">Baseball</category><icon src="https://cdn.tvpassport.com/image/show/960x540/v2/p10548110_b_v8_aa.jpg"/></programme>
