<programme start="20261012002400 +0000" stop="20261012011800 +0000" channel="The Walking Dead Channel"><title lang="es">The Walking Dead</title><sub-title lang="es">Diverged</sub-title><desc lang="es">At the lowest point in their friendship, Daryl and Carol come to a fork in the road and head their separate ways; Carol returns to Alexandria, while Daryl stays on the road, each going into their own type of survival mode.</desc><credits><director>David Boyd</director><actor>Norman Reedus</actor><actor>Melissa McBride</actor><actor>Lauren Cohan</actor><actor>Jeffrey Dean Morgan</actor><actor>Cassady McClincy</actor><actor>Danai Gurira</actor><actor>Josh McDermitt</actor><actor>Christian Serratos</actor><actor>Seth Gilliam</actor><actor>Ross Marquand</actor><actor>Khary Payton</actor><actor>Cooper Andrews</actor><actor>Avi Nash</actor><actor>Callan McAuliffe</actor><actor>Nadia Hilker</actor><actor>Eleanor Matsuura</actor><actor>Lauren Ridloff</actor><actor>Cailey Fleming</actor><actor>Samantha Morton</actor><actor>Ryan Hurst</actor></credits><date>20210328</date><episode-num system="xmltv_ns">9.20.0/1</episode-num><episode-num system="onscreen">S10E21</episode-num><rating><value>US_UPR_TV-MA</value></rating><icon src="http://p-img.movetv.com/cms/images/269320c2a0daf79a9fdaaf292ae223380e6290e3.jpg"/></programme>
